  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to support the implementation of the third Gender Action Plan in Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective (Impact) to which this action contributes is to make the EU a strategic player in the promotion of gender equality and women&#xbf;s empowerment (GEWE) in Cameroon, both internally across the Delegation&#xbf;s operations and programmes, and externally towards the EU&#xbf;s partners. In this light, this contract will aim at supporting the Delegation in the implementation of the commitments of EU Gender Action Plan III, operationalised in the Cameroon Country Level Implementation Plan (CLIP).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
